    <ThingDef ParentName="Mugirl_ArmorSmithableBase">
        <defName>Mugirl_PlateArmor</defName>
        <!-- 雪牛娘 中世纪甲胄 -->
        <label>Mugirl Plate Armour</label>
        <!-- 由多片精钢板铆接而成的中世纪重型板甲，能在正面迎击弩箭与刀剑的袭来。表面打磨如镜，重量却惊人，只有体力充沛的雪牛娘才能在战场上长时间穿戴。虽然机动性受到压制，但其提供的绝对防护足以让穿戴者化作钢铁壁垒。 -->
        <description>A heavy medieval cuirass of riveted refined steel plates, built to meet bolts and blades head-on. Its mirror-bright finish belies tremendous weight, and only a strong Mugirl can endure wearing it for long on the battlefield. Mobility is sacrificed, but the protection it offers is so absolute that the wearer becomes a walking bulwark of steel.</description>
        <possessionCount>1</possessionCount>
        <recipeMaker>
            <unfinishedThingDef>UnfinishedMetallicTechArmor</unfinishedThingDef>
            <researchPrerequisite>PlateArmor</researchPrerequisite>
            <skillRequirements>
                <Crafting>7</Crafting>
            </skillRequirements>
            <displayPriority>250</displayPriority>
        </recipeMaker>
        <graphicData>
            <texPath>Things/Apparel/Mugirl_PlateArmor/Mugirl_PlateArmor</texPath>
            <graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
        </graphicData>
        <stuffCategories>
            <li>Metallic</li>
            <li>Woody</li>
        </stuffCategories>
        <costStuffCount>170</costStuffCount>
        <statBases>
            <WorkToMake>38000</WorkToMake>
            <MaxHitPoints>290</MaxHitPoints>
            <Mass>15</Mass>
            <StuffEffectMultiplierArmor>0.8</StuffEffectMultiplierArmor>
            <StuffEffectMultiplierInsulation_Cold>1.0</StuffEffectMultiplierInsulation_Cold>
            <StuffEffectMultiplierInsulation_Heat>0</StuffEffectMultiplierInsulation_Heat>
            <EquipDelay>15</EquipDelay>
        </statBases>
        <thingSetMakerTags>
            <li>RewardStandardQualitySuper</li>
        </thingSetMakerTags>
        <equippedStatOffsets>
            <MoveSpeed>-0.8</MoveSpeed>
        </equippedStatOffsets>
        <thingCategories>
            <li>ApparelArmor</li>
        </thingCategories>
        <apparel>
            <tags>
                <li>Mugirl_Armor</li>
            </tags>
            <bodyPartGroups>
                <li>Torso</li>
                <li>Neck</li>
                <li>Shoulders</li>
                <li>Arms</li>
                <li>Legs</li>
            </bodyPartGroups>
            <wornGraphicPath>Things/Apparel/Mugirl_PlateArmor/Mugirl_PlateArmor</wornGraphicPath>
            <layers>
                <li>Shell</li>
            </layers>
            <tags>
                <li>Mugirl_Armor</li>
            </tags>
            <defaultOutfitTags>
                <li>Soldier</li>
            </defaultOutfitTags>
        </apparel>
        <colorGenerator Class="ColorGenerator_Options">
            <options>
                <li>
                    <weight>10</weight>
                    <only>(0.33,0.33,0.33)</only>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <weight>10</weight>
                    <only>(0.65,0.65,0.65)</only>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <weight>6</weight>
                    <min>(0.3,0.3,0.3)</min>
                    <max>(0.5,0.5,0.5)</max>
                </li>
            </options>
        </colorGenerator>
    </ThingDef>

    <ThingDef ParentName="ApparelMakeableBase">
        <defName>Mugirl_Coat</defName>
        <!-- 雪牛娘 大衣 -->
        <label>Mugirl Coat</label>
        <!-- 剪裁利落的长款大衣，垂坠线条随步伐轻摆，外表从容而克制。它并非为抵御寒风而生，而是用来掩藏内里的装束与真实意图。衣襟合拢之间，将锋芒、秘密与未示人的身份一并收起，只让世界看到你愿意呈现的那一面。 -->
        <description>A sharply tailored long coat whose draped lines sway lightly with each step, calm and restrained on the outside. It was not made to fend off cold wind, but to conceal the clothing beneath and the intentions within. When the front is closed, it gathers away edges, secrets, and identities yet unseen, showing the world only the side you choose to present.</description>
        <graphicData>
            <texPath>Things/Apparel/Mugirl_Coat/Mugirl_Coat</texPath>
            <graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
        </graphicData>
        <techLevel>Medieval</techLevel>
        <costStuffCount>25</costStuffCount>
        <stuffCategories>
            <li>Fabric</li>
            <li>Leathery</li>
        </stuffCategories>
        <statBases>
            <MaxHitPoints>50</MaxHitPoints>
            <WorkToMake>1000</WorkToMake>
            <Mass>0.5</Mass>
            <StuffEffectMultiplierInsulation_Cold>0.2</StuffEffectMultiplierInsulation_Cold>
            <StuffEffectMultiplierInsulation_Heat>0.2</StuffEffectMultiplierInsulation_Heat>
            <EquipDelay>1.5</EquipDelay>
        </statBases>
        <recipeMaker>
            <researchPrerequisite>ComplexClothing</researchPrerequisite>
            <skillRequirements>
                <Crafting>3</Crafting>
            </skillRequirements>
            <displayPriority>250</displayPriority>
        </recipeMaker>
        <thingCategories>
            <li>ApparelMisc</li>
        </thingCategories>
        <apparel>
            <tags>
                <li>Mugirl_Shell</li>
            </tags>
            <drawData>
                <defaultData>
                    <layer>300</layer>
                </defaultData>
            </drawData>
            <bodyPartGroups>
                <li>Torso</li>
            </bodyPartGroups>
            <countsAsClothingForNudity>false</countsAsClothingForNudity>
            <wornGraphicPath>Things/Apparel/Mugirl_Coat/Mugirl_Coat</wornGraphicPath>
            <layers>
                <li>Mugirl_Ornament</li>
            </layers>
            <canBeDesiredForIdeo>false</canBeDesiredForIdeo>
        </apparel>
    </ThingDef>

    <ThingDef ParentName="ApparelMakeableBase">
        <defName>Mugirl_KnightlyOrnament</defName>
        <!-- 雪牛娘 骑士颈饰 -->
        <label>Mugirl Knightly Ornament</label>
        <!-- 骑士颈饰由柔韧皮革与抛光金属片编缀而成，贴合颈部弧线，戴上时既稳固又不失优雅。中央镶嵌一枚细致的纹章徽片，随动作微微晃动，以低调的光泽彰显骑士的身份与荣耀。条带边缘以细线缝合，触感柔和，不会在奔走或战斗时磨损皮肤。它既是装饰，也是象征，代表着骑士对誓言与荣誉的无声守护。 -->
        <description>A knightly neck ornament woven from supple leather and polished metal plates, shaped to follow the curve of the throat with both stability and grace. A finely worked heraldic emblem rests at its centre and sways subtly with each motion, its muted sheen declaring honour without ostentation. Soft stitching along the edges keeps it comfortable even while running or fighting. It is both adornment and symbol, a quiet pledge to oath and glory.</description>
        <graphicData>
            <texPath>Things/Apparel/Mugirl_KnightlyOrnament/Mugirl_KnightlyOrnament</texPath>
            <graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
        </graphicData>
        <techLevel>Medieval</techLevel>
        <costStuffCount>25</costStuffCount>
        <stuffCategories>
            <li>Fabric</li>
            <li>Leathery</li>
